        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The process "petrol, burned in building machine, with particle filter/MJ/CH" has been modified to generate a dataset that consider the emissions produced during the combustion of 1 MJ of petrol fuel in a building machine in Switzerland.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset is based on the process "Diesel, burned in building machine {GLO}|". Compared to this reference process, the dataset includes only lubricating oil, diesel fuel and the emissions produced during the combustion of 1 MJ of petrol fuel in an average building machine in Switzerland.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
